OL,3,ANumber of people missing after Nepal
OL,4,Aflash floods jumps significantly to
OL,5,Anearly 2,000
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 1,924 people are missing in
OL,8,FNepal following Wednesday's flash
OL,9,Ffloods, the Nepalese disaster relief
OL,10,Fagency says
OL,12,FAmong them are at least 517 foreign
OL,13,Fnationals - but the situation is
OL,14,Ffast-moving and different authorities
OL,15,Fhave produced different figures
OL,17,FThe death toll in Nepal has risen to
OL,18,F579, the disaster relief agency says,
OL,19,Fand at least five people have died in
OL,20,FTibet, with 558 reported missing there
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
