OL,3,ANumber of people missing after Nepal
OL,4,Aflash floods jumps significantly to
OL,5,Anearly 2,000
OL,6,
OL,7,FWe are relying on reports from Chinese
OL,8,Fstate media about the situation in
OL,9,FTibet - our Beijing correspondent
OL,10,Fexplains why
OL,12,FA collapsed glacier caused the huge
OL,13,Fflood wave, local officials tell the
OL,14,FBBC. The surge tore through houses and
OL,15,Froads, and destroyed a key Nepal-Tibet
OL,16,Fborder crossing
